From: Pixel <53497640+ImPixeluwu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:14:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Save the World Homebase overview

New read-only page under STW Operations that shows the Storm Shield of
each campaign zone for the active account, read from the "metadata" MCP
profile: Storm Shield level, highest Endurance wave, placed amplifiers
and the accounts with edit permission (names resolved in batches of up
to 100 ids). Zones without a Storm Shield core are shown as locked.

- getQueryProfileMetadata MCP request and findUsersByAccountIds lookup
- Pure parser in src/lib/parsers/homebase.ts with vitest coverage
- homebase:get-overview IPC channel and preload bridge
- Sidebar entry, customizable menu option and en-US/es-419 texts
